<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were</p>
<p>loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on</p>
<p>Monday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Verona		   soda	     ldg	  7,000</p>
<p> - Majestic		 gen goods	ldg	 12,000</p>
<p> - Perseus		  rolled metal   ldg	  7,200</p>
<p> - Aslan 1		  rolled metal   ldg	  5,090</p>
<p> - Ananghel Endeav	rolled metal   ldg *	6,000</p>
<p> - Vulcan		   phosphate	dsg	 11,800</p>
<p> - Orhan Deval	    urea	     ldg	 23,000</p>
<p> - Sibonancy		coal	     dsg	 76,026</p>
<p> - Laemthong Pride	sugar	    dsg	 14,000</p>
<p> - Step		     concrete iron  ldg	  6,000</p>
<p> - Black Sea T	    cement	   ldg	  9,500</p>
<p>* cargo in transit</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
